saveas(gcf, "figures/boxplot_PC5_DFS.png"); %[output:3904aadc]
%[text] PC5 scores tended to be higher in recurrent/progressed patients than in censored patients, although the distributions overlapped substantially. The overlap indicates that PC5 alone does not clearly separate the two outcome groups.
%%
